From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AGC Developer <developer@agc.com>
Date: Sun, 06 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] AGC Lithium same-class projectile scan skip

Ender pearls never hit ender pearls (vanilla rejects them in canHitEntity
via isPickable), yet every pearl in a dense stasis stack pays full
inflate+clip math against every other pearl each tick. This pre-filters
same-class pearls from the scan when the source is a ThrownEnderpearl.
Hit results are identical; only wasted per-candidate work is skipped.
Gated by AgcCapabilityMatrix LITHIUM_COLLISION_ENGINE (baseline-safe).

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/entity/projectile/ProjectileUtil.java b/net/minecraft/world/entity/projectile/ProjectileUtil.java
--- a/net/minecraft/world/entity/projectile/ProjectileUtil.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/entity/projectile/ProjectileUtil.java
@@ -157,17 +157,28 @@ public class ProjectileUtil {
     public static @Nullable EntityHitResult getEntityHitResult(
         final Level level,
         final Entity source,
         final Vec3 from,
         final Vec3 to,
         final AABB targetSearchArea,
         final Predicate<Entity> matching,
         final float entityMargin
     ) {
+        // AGC start - Lithium same-class projectile skip (identical hit results, skips wasted clip math)
+        final Predicate<Entity> agc$matching;
+        if (source instanceof net.minecraft.world.entity.projectile.throwableitemprojectile.ThrownEnderpearl
+            && io.papermc.paper.agc.AgcCapabilityMatrix.isEnabled(io.papermc.paper.agc.AgcCapabilityMatrix.Feature.LITHIUM_COLLISION_ENGINE)) {
+            agc$matching = matching.and(
+                entity -> entity.getClass() != net.minecraft.world.entity.projectile.throwableitemprojectile.ThrownEnderpearl.class
+            );
+        } else {
+            agc$matching = matching;
+        }
+        // AGC end - Lithium same-class projectile skip
         double nearest = Double.MAX_VALUE;
         Optional<Vec3> nearestLocation = Optional.empty();
         Entity hitEntity = null;
 
-        for (Entity entity : level.getEntities(source, targetSearchArea, matching)) {
+        for (Entity entity : level.getEntities(source, targetSearchArea, agc$matching)) {
             AABB bb = entity.getBoundingBox().inflate(entityMargin);
             Optional<Vec3> location = bb.clip(from, to);
             if (location.isPresent()) {
